%% Travel-planning map for a one-week international holiday.
# International Travel Plan
## Destination
- City and region
  - Seasonal weather
- Entry requirements
  - Passport and visa
## Transport
- Flights
  - Compare baggage rules
- Local mobility
  - Rail pass or transit card
## Stay
- Accommodation
  - Location and cancellation
- Budget
  - Daily spending limit
## Itinerary
- Priority sights
  - Timed reservations
- Food and culture
  - Neighbourhood recommendations
